<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Returns Policy</h1>
        <p>Hassle-free returns. We want you to love your purchase.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== MAIN CONTENT ===== -->
<main class="container mb-5">

    <div class="content-card">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Our Promise</h4>
        <p>At ShopyGo, we stand behind the quality of our products. If you're not completely satisfied with your purchase, we're here to help with a hassle-free return process.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> Return Window</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Standard Items:</strong> 7 days from delivery date</li>
            <li><strong>Electronics:</strong> 5 days from delivery date</li>
            <li><strong>Fashion & Apparel:</strong> 7 days from delivery date</li>
            <li><strong>Beauty & Personal Care:</strong> 3 days from delivery date</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-muted small mt-2"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> Returns are accepted only for unused items in original packaging.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-clipboard-list"></i> How to Return</h4>
        <div class="return-steps">
            <div class="return-step">
                <div class="step-number">1</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h6>Initiate Return</h6>
                    <p>Log in to your account, go to "My Orders", and click "Return" on the order you wish to return.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="return-step">
                <div class="step-number">2</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h6>Select Reason</h6>
                    <p>Choose the reason for return and provide any additional details or photos if needed.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="return-step">
                <div class="step-number">3</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h6>Pickup Arrangement</h6>
                    <p>Our courier partner will schedule a pickup from your address within 24-48 hours.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="return-step">
                <div class="step-number">4</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h6>Quality Check</h6>
                    <p>Once received, our team will inspect the item. Refund will be processed within 3-5 business days.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-credit-card"></i> Refund Options</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Refund to Bank Account:</strong> 3-5 business days</li>
            <li><strong>Refund to Original Payment Method:</strong> 5-7 business days</li>
            <li><strong>Store Credit:</strong> Instant (available immediately)</li>
            <li><strong>Exchange:</strong> Available for select products (size/color change)</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> Non-Returnable Items</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>Personal care products (opened)</li>
            <li>Underwear and swimwear</li>
            <li>Custom-made items</li>
            <li>Digital products</li>
            <li>Gift cards</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-headset"></i> Need Help?</h4>
        <p>If you have any questions about returns, our support team is here to help:</p>
        <p><i class="fas fa-phone-alt text-primary me-2"></i> +91 1800 202 8899</p>
        <p><i class="fas fa-envelope text-primary me-2"></i> support@shopygo.com</p>
    </div>

</main>


